{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5425ef0c3679d76887c66c492e9fa07081382060e81cc88d33d67cd61459114c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb080f7a784796a06053b45d338ee8a5899f56831ea8c475054ddf5b6feb54cf",
      "text": "诶，我吗？\n那个，我们以前在哪儿见过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:470704f96abae23cf09150973b7db480d8756b8cf656a623905edb1586001868",
      "text": "啊，没有，初次见面。\n我是这家公司的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c98169e337284dc3cfded253d88a58debf1f67ff4e3e4eb2f1e4348407f6aab",
      "text": "315、Production？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c08c54fa790c904737e7ddd5aef48b1adb5bfa49426340ca1fcde484550f38d4",
      "text": "是的。我在那家事务所\n担任偶像制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2cbaca1a845d14071f2e04e9cf5091472507b8246d05040d55fc10c7fe5114b",
      "text": "偶像的，制作人……\n啊，我是柏木翼。请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f839ffd5a8d7dbfa62cdd84af492c91171d4d4afe415573a2b853970982f7b39",
      "text": "那么……偶像事务所的人，\n找我有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2ecb5b5b3c8ef5f99cab16064255fa8e1bad4af04c51773afe4a070d27cb886",
      "text": "其实，我想问问您\n对偶像有没有兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4bce2bd35edbe91b11e1d5a03758b296257a8ae26a7f873f24329f880c72675",
      "text": "诶……对偶像，有兴趣……？\n这难不成是说，要发掘我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:637231e871b5a547b970a5e7df2a4c0125da8a0925ec3d1785efad7dff2474da",
      "text": "可是我什么都没做吧？\n根本没什么值得让您感兴趣的地方啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d85f1337f6a6cf52055a48151e28c1c6feb41947a6e356e53c3d43d2c4510099",
      "text": "不，刚才您用餐时的表情，是那种能让在旁看着的\n人也感到幸福的笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18bd099144d3285659c61cd4243352dda828757a79b30d8b9a68f27168c7becf",
      "text": "我认为那样的笑容，正是偶像所需的资质！\n如果可以的话，能听我多说两句吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
